        "### Introduction\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook explores supervised machine learning classification\n",
        "by training and evaluating six different models on the Wine dataset\n",
        "from Scikit-learn.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Wine dataset contains 178 samples with 13 chemical features\n",
        "such as alcohol content, acidity, and flavonoids, used to classify\n",
        "wines into three cultivar categories.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objectives\n",
        "- Explore the dataset and perform exploratory data analysis (EDA)\n",
        "- Prepare and split the data for training and testing\n",
        "- Build six classification models:\n",
        "    - Logistic Regression\n",
        "    - Decision Tree\n",
        "    - Random Forest\n",
        "    - k-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)\n",
        "    - Naive Bayes\n",
        "    - Support Vector Machine (SVM)\n",
        "- Evaluate each model using accuracy, classification report,\n",
        "  and confusion matrix\n",
        "- Compare models and identify the best performer"
